```tsquare
board "File manager"
  screen desktop
    navbar "Files" leading=back actions=[search, grid]
    stack padding=16 grow
      table columns=[Name, Size, Modified, Type] rows=10
    drawer right "Details" size=320
      stack padding=16 gap=16
        heading "Document.pdf" level=2
        text "Size: 2.5 MB" muted
        text "Modified: Today at 3:45 PM" muted
        text "Created: Oct 1, 2026" muted
        button "Download" fullWidth
        button "Share" variant=secondary fullWidth
```
